  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is the solution of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mi>cos</mi><mi>y</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>; then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to _______."
  },
